    <node id="&quot;PHENOMENON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Phenomenon refers to the unique experience at Klockgjutargränd that allows visitors to step from medieval Stockholm to modern-day Montreal."</data>
